## Defaults (optional)

- Keep core rules independent of view/UI where practical.
- Prefer simple composition and clear ownership over speculative frameworks.
- Treat input, save data, settings, audio, UI, and analytics as explicit seams.
- Lock Unity version and packages per project; never auto-upgrade across the portfolio.

